# ==============================================================================
# FAQ CHATBOT ENTERPRISE — FRONTEND ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION
# File: frontend/.env.example
# ==============================================================================
# 🤖 MODELS USED BY THE BACKEND:
# - Embedding Model: text-embedding-3-small (1500 Dimensions)
# - LLM Generation:  gpt-4o-mini (Grounded FAQ Generation)
